Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' NOTECTL_SOURCE=obsidian NOTECTL_VAULT_PATH=$HOME/vault; $DEMO_DIR/seed-notectl.sh; clear"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Type "notectl"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 700ms
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
